 "readings": [
  "No FX conversion: every window instrument is USD-quoted (6B, 6M; commodities), so t2022.Mkt receives an empty EUR/GBP frame",
  "D2: the A9 rolling statistics use each market's history from 1977 up to the window end; issues are counted from the window's first execution to the execution after 1999-12 (the exit of December's positions); a unit break is a non-reversing same-contract move above 30% whose factor is within 2% of a power of ten (a price-unit rescaling); other such moves are market moves and are listed",
  "Window check (Amendment 2): t2022.build_targets alone (no Sleeve) for each full sleeve over its window and the month before; at least 6 active in every window month and fewer than 6 in the month before",
  "T22 half universes (context): target months with fewer than 6 active instruments hold nothing (section 4.5); the full T22 sleeve has at least 6 in every window month, so nothing is zeroed there",
  "T21: the 12 holding months are measured between consecutive decision dates (the twelve months to t, settlements up to and including t), from the chained F1 and F2 indices",
  "The 10% single-market risk cap of section 2.4 (a sleeve-construction convention) is applied to all three sleeves, measured with each sleeve's own sigma"
 ],
